  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Quad UV, normalised age, a per-particle random number and the particle colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_rot",
        "position": {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1374
        },
        "text": "`turns = random + age × spin`: each puff starts rotated differently and turns slowly while it rises."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_noise",
        "position": {
          "x": 2104,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "Layer 1 at the base tiling, layer 2 at 0.55× with a different offset drifting upward with age. `noise = lerp(n₁, n₂, 0.4)` has two interacting scales, which reads as billowing."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_alpha",
        "position": {
          "x": 4380,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "`puff = noise × round falloff`, `round = 1 − smoothstep(0.15, 0.5, |uv − ½|)`. The threshold `age × erosion` rises over the particle's life; `smoothstep(threshold, threshold + softness, puff)` keeps what is above it."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_color",
        "position": {
          "x": 4380,
          "y": 600
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1766
        },
        "text": "Fake lighting: `l = saturate(uv.y × 0.8 + (noise − ½) × 0.6)` — the top of the puff and the thin parts are lighter. Colour = `lerp(shadow, light, l)` × particle colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_soft",
        "position": {
          "x": 6350,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "Depth fade × erosion alpha × particle alpha × *Opacity*."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 8014,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Alpha blend, ZWrite off, two-sided."
      }
    ],
